{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13019","headline":"题刘相公三湘图 · 郎士元","name":"题刘相公三湘图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔别醉衡霍，迩来忆南州。\n今朝平津邸，兼得潇湘游。\n稍辨郢门树，依然芳杜洲。\n微明三巴峡，咫尺万里流。\n飞鸟不知倦，远帆生暮愁。\n涔阳指天末，北渚空悠悠。\n枕上见渔父，坐中常狎鸥。\n谁言魏阙下，自有东山幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}